  "description": "\n  \n  The GrandTour Dataset\n  \n\n\n  A project brought to you by RSL - ETH Zurich.\n\n\n  References \u2022\n  Contributing  \u2022\n  Citation\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tReferences\n\t\n\n\nOfficial dataset webpage: grand-tour.leggedrobotics.com\nGetting started & examples: github.com/leggedrobotics/grand_tour_dataset\nBoxi used to collect the data: github.com/leggedrobotics/grand_tour_box\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContributing\n\t\n\nWe warmly welcome contributions to improve and expand this project. Whether it's new examples, enhancements, or\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/leggedrobotics/grand_tour_dataset.",
